      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's interesting. It sounds like there are a lot of hidden ways these nutrients interact. Can you explain how those spikes can feel so \"tricky\" or deceptive to the body? I'm trying to understand why the body can't always anticipate these sudden, sharp rises in glucose, almost as if the food is bypassing the usual regulatory mechanisms.",
